Subject: [PATCH 2/2] B-07, B-08, B-10: webhook redelivery, event-driven
 off-hours ack, global pause

LOCAL ONLY - not pushed, not deployed.
- B-07 whatsappWebhook: an inbound message that fails returns 500 so Meta
  redelivers; a duplicate that slips past the pre-check is dropped after insert
  and skips side effects. Status receipts never fail the delivery.
- B-08 off-hours ack moved from the processAlerts sweep to the webhook: only for
  messages received while closed, once per closed period, free-form text.
- B-10 automations_enabled is now a real global pause: sendMessage refuses every
  internal-key send, reparoBridge stops customer notices, red banner in inbox.

